msgstr "Protected route configuration"

msgid "Choose the REST API prefixes that must require the API key. You can keep the default WordPress content routes and add broader prefixes such as /wp/v2/ or custom plugin namespaces if needed."
msgstr "Choose the REST API prefixes that must require the API key. You can keep the default WordPress content routes and add broader prefixes such as /wp/v2/ or custom plugin namespaces if needed."

msgid "Block the whole REST API by default"
msgstr "Block the whole REST API by default"

msgid "When enabled, public exceptions stay open, selected routes require the API key, and every other REST API route is blocked."
msgstr "When enabled, public exceptions stay open, selected routes require the API key, and every other REST API route is blocked."

